      "comment": "Zmei: The Luchkin",
      "content": "The Luchkin are one of the fae gangs of the High Table. Their base is in Zolnyy. They help the poor: Vasiliy complains that destitute beggars are sent to report to Luchkin. Members include Sofya and the infiltrator Gureva; Zmei guides them.\n\nZmei says the Luchkin would never let friends who came to their aid leave disappointed.",
