      ],
      "comment": "Zmei: The High Table",
      "content": "The High Table is an informal alliance of Snezhnaya's fae gangs founded by Izmaylov and the surviving heroes who ended the Burner of Cities' rebellion. Its Laws forbid harm to families and the abuse of women and children, require debts to be repaid and demand acts of mercy and justice.\n\nVasiliy rejected the Table and the Laws as a leash. Zmei says that if the Shadow Realm spread to the Druzhna, the entire Table would be finished.",
