        "Izmaylov"
      ],
      "comment": "Zmei: Vasiliy and the Shadow Realm",
      "content": "Vasiliy Nikolayevich Izmaylov, the Young Sire, killed the Old Sire after being refused the Old Sire's Shadow Realm work. He then refined Kresnik Kristall to open the Shadow Realm at the train boneyard. Zmei, Iryna and the Traveler stopped him; defeated and blind in the unstable realm, Vasiliy asked Zmei to take him away, and a funeral for him is mentioned afterward.\n\nVasiliy believed the gangs were dogs of the Druzhna and the Energy Commission. His final words recall being found as a child.",
